{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There once was a witch who lived in the woods...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She would explore those woods in pursuit of a personal goal.  These woods were mysterious, but that would not stop her from completing her quest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She wasn't alone of course.  She had her familiar Merlin, a housecat who slept on the couch.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Her story is that of exploration and fantasy as she traverses these winter woods.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633020/extras/walking.gif?t=1763744647\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect materials to craft resources and tools to explore deeper into the woods</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A limited day cycle that encourages you to plan how to explore each day</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hand-drawn graphics in a 3D monochromatic world</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A lovely soundtrack by Dreamware</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yes, you can pet the cat</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Quest Complete","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3633020/455d60e515aa457d0c834dd09e322b4add01bf61.jpg"},{"name":"A Good Roommate","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3633020/04c472cab6cd784fb516744f7ce777b7bbafb98d.jpg"},{"name":"Have Bush, Will Travel","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3633020/5dd266083ad01e776003cbb6bed532b76e637eb7.jpg"},{"name":"The Truth of the Matter","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3633020/39a940f9a8f4620fabf20f017b194befdaf82c03.jpg"}],"total":4},"background":"https://store.aka